{"key": "3d20a7a1b2a3b9c928daa8c5", "model": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash", "content": "**ERR-PO-0412: Tax region does not match supplier state** means the tax code selected on the order is for the wrong region (MAN-PUR-72 \u00a717.2). \n\n* **Cause:** A supplier located in the plant's own state requires an `-INTRA` code (CGST + SGST), whereas an out-of-state supplier requires an `-INTER` code (IGST). The Fetch function defaults to `GST18-INTRA` (MAN-PUR-72 \u00a717.2).\n* **Fix:** Change the tax code to the corresponding `-INTER` code at the same rate (such as `GST18-INTER`) and save the order again (MAN-PUR-72 \u00a717.2).", "tool_calls": [], "tokens_in": 1209, "tokens_out": 166, "seconds": 3.207}
{"key": "3ee28167e3f48d69180813a6", "model": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash", "content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_2705942", "name": "search_policy", "arguments": {"question": "ERR-PO-0412"}, "extra": {"google": {"thought_signature": ""}}}], "tokens_in": 327, "tokens_out": 23, "seconds": 1.486}
{"key": "86565b994b40bf2e29978efb", "model": "gemini:gemini-3.8-flash", "content": "**ERR-PO-0412: Tax region does not match supplier state**\n\n* **Meaning:** The tax code selected is for the wrong region. The `Fetch` function always defaults to `GST18-INTRA` (CGST + SGST), which applies only to suppliers within the plant's own state. A supplier located in any other state requires an `-INTER` code (IGST) (MAN-PUR-72 \u00a717.2, MAN-PUR-72 \u00a711.4).\n* **How to fix it:** Change the tax code to the corresponding `-INTER` code at the same rate (for example, `GST18-INTER`) and save again. You can press **F2** in the Tax code field to view available codes (MAN-PUR-72 \u00a711.4, MAN-PUR-72 \u00a717.2).", "tool_calls": [], "tokens_in": 1201, "tokens_out": 190, "seconds": 3.67}
