{"key": "383143b06554d60f21c846d3", "model": "openrouter:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "content": "Whether you can buy gaskets from Shakti Seals depends on their status in Bahi, which I cannot see directly:\n\n1. **Food-contact qualification:** Gaskets touch food, so they can only be purchased from a supplier holding a valid food-grade certificate on file in Bahi (POL-PUR-001 \u00a76.2, POL-SUP-003 \u00a74.1). \n2. **Certificate validity:** The test report must be from an accredited food-contact materials laboratory (POL-SUP-003 \u00a74.2), issued within the last 12 months, and have a valid-to date at least 60 days after the date the order is placed (AMD-SUP-2026-02 \u00a71.1).\n3. **Supplier onboarding:** If Shakti Seals is not yet an onboarded supplier in Bahi, they must be approved by the Purchase Manager before being created (POL-SUP-003 \u00a73.4).\n4. **Approval limits:** When placing the order, your purchase limit as a Purchase Executive is \u20b92,50,000 gross; orders above this must be approved by your manager (POL-PUR-001 \u00a75.2, POL-APR-002 \u00a75.1).\n\nThe documents do not contain specific details or existing approvals for Shakti Seals. Please check their vendor status and certificate in Bahi before placing the order.", "tool_calls": [], "tokens_in": 2370, "tokens_out": 302, "seconds": 3.84}
